Copyright 2026 Paris Michalas, NetProjects. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Builds on Tencent DSpine (https://github.com/Tencent/DSpine, Apache-2.0,
commit 0cc92d8), whose dspine_mlx package it imports, and on mlx-lm
(Apple, MIT). dspine_hybrid/hybrid_target.py contains a copy of
mlx-lm 0.32.2's qwen3_5.GatedDeltaNet.__call__; dspine_hybrid/draft.py
contains adapted copies of dspine_mlx DraftAttention.__call__ and
load_draft. Not affiliated with Tencent, Alibaba/Qwen or Apple.

dspine_hybrid/multirow_attn.py is a copy of mlx-dspark's
src/mlx_dspark/multirow_attn.py (https://github.com/ARahim3/mlx-dspark,
MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 erahim3, commit b4a40fb26594); its licence text is
at the top of that file.

The optional fast paths (--fast-verify, --a8-prefill) call Metal kernels
from oMLX (https://github.com/jundot/omlx, Apache-2.0) when it is
installed. No oMLX code is included in this repository. The
dspine-omlx-kernels wheel attached to the releases is oMLX's unmodified
Python package at commit e1a402cf with its kernel extensions built; it
carries oMLX's LICENSE. Not affiliated with the oMLX project.
